{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":20,"ref":"2-chronicles 20:20","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"pcm","chapter":20,"translation":"And dem wake up early for morning, and dem go out go di wilderness of Teqoa; and as dem dey go out, Yehoshafat stand, and im talk sey, Hear me, Yehudah and di people wey dey stay for Yerushalayim: believe for Yahweh, una Elohim, and una go stand firm; believe for im nabi dem, and una go succeed.","tokens":[{"surface":"וישכימו","gloss":"and dem wake up early"},{"surface":"בבקר","gloss":"for morning"},{"surface":"ויצאו","gloss":"and dem go out"},{"surface":"למדבר","gloss":"go di wilderness"},{"surface":"תקוע","gloss":"Teqoa"},{"surface":"ובצאתם","gloss":"and as dem dey go out"},{"surface":"עמד","gloss":"stand"},{"surface":"יהושפט","gloss":"Yehoshafat"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"and im talk sey"},{"surface":"שמעוני","gloss":"hear me"},{"surface":"יהודה","gloss":"Yehudah"},{"surface":"וישבי","gloss":"and di people wey dey stay"},{"surface":"ירושלם","gloss":"Yerushalayim"},{"surface":"האמינו","gloss":"believe"},{"surface":"ביהוה","gloss":"for Yahweh"},{"surface":"אלהיכם","gloss":"una Elohim"},{"surface":"ותאמנו","gloss":"and una go stand firm"},{"surface":"האמינו","gloss":"believe"},{"surface":"בנביאיו","gloss":"for im nabi dem"},{"surface":"והצליחו","gloss":"and una go succeed"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-11T14:12:00.166201111Z","model":"glm-5.2"}